  description: '(When you activate this card, you can also reveal 1 "Gunkan Suship
    Shari" in your hand.) Reveal 3 "Gunkan" monsters from your Deck, your opponent
    chooses 1 of them for you to add to your hand, also shuffle the rest into your
    Deck. If you revealed "Gunkan Suship Shari" in your hand at activation, you can
    choose the card to add to your hand, instead of your opponent choosing. If this
    card is in your GY, except the turn it was sent there: You can banish this card,
    then target 3 "Gunkan" monsters in your GY; shuffle them into the Deck, then
    draw 1 card.'
